media.accuracy_constraints:
seconds hand angle = numeral x 30: left on 9 = 270 degrees, right on 12 = 0 (360) degrees
from 9 to 12 is 3 numerals x 5 s = 15 seconds, equal to the LP answer (60 - 45 = 15)
right minute hand is one mark (6 degrees) past the left one (186 vs 180) because the seconds hand has just completed a minute; hour hand (5 + 30/60) x 30 = 165 and (5 + 31/60) x 30 = 165.5
